# 🤖 Lorapok Core

- 🏗️ CommonJS only (`require` / `module.exports`).
- 🚨 Use `lib/errors.js` and `lib/logger.js` — no silent catches.
- 🔐 Never commit secrets or `.env`.
- ✅ Run `npm test` before finishing tasks that change code.
- 🧠 Read `BRAIN.md` and `.agents/rules/` at task start.
- 📚 **Context is Auto-Assembled**: Rely on `ContextAssembler` for semantic indexing in `/analyze` and `/chat`. Avoid blind `fs.readFileSync` dumps that blow up the token window.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Post-Prompt Trigger**: After your prompt response is complete, ALWAYS review and update corresponding architecture documentation and tests.
